name=Viewpoint Geometry Fix (Diagnostics)
id=ViewpointGeometryFix
author=ViewpointGeometryFix contributors
modversion=0.1.3-diag
require=\ZombieBuddy
javaJarFile=media/java/client/ViewpointGeometryFix.jar
javaPkgName=vpgeometryfix
ZBVersionMin=2.3.2
description=Diagnostic-only companion for Project Viewpoint. Detects Viewpoint, ZombieBuddy and the game version, logs [VPGeometryFix] lines and, in debug mode, dumps read-only information about the tile/object you target. Does NOT change rendering, gameplay, save games or any game/Viewpoint file. Controlled through an in-game window (opens when a save loads) and the world right-click menu "VPGeometryFix"; no default hotkeys.
